    <longDescription xmi:type="utility:ConstantString" string="When a async http side call has to be definied, please add this subflow.&#xD;&#xA;3 subflow Parameters are mandatory &#xD;&#xA; - monitoring-api-name --> used to monitoring&#xD;&#xA; - monitoring-api-operation --> used to monitoring&#xD;&#xA; - Unique Identifier --> use to request/response asynchrone mechanism&#xD;&#xA;Before this subflow, if business-identifiers has to be defined in TCS monitoring, please create this input tree&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;LocalEnvironment.&quot;business-identifiers&quot;.key1 = 'Value1';&#xD;&#xA;LocalEnvironment.&quot;business-identifiers&quot;.key2 = 'Value2';"/>
